# Hedge Shredder watches land cards put into YOUR graveyard FROM YOUR LIBRARY. Bot1's Thought Scour mills two Forests from Bot2's
# library into Bot2's graveyard: neither enters for Bot1. Faithless Looting then draws two Forests and Bot1 discards two Forests from
# its hand to its own graveyard: they come from the hand, not the library, and stay in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Hedge Shredder
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Thought Scour
Faithless Looting
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x30

